Cloned Pipeline Iq backend to shounakverse
Pipeline Iq backend is deployed from Shounakverse

For this backend deployment shounakverse account has been used

Following structure has been use

Render service 	1: FastAPI Web Service Render service 
				2: Celery Background Worker 
Neon: Postgres database 
Upstash: Redis queue SonarQube 
Cloud: Code quality scan 




For frontend deployment used Netlify
Account used shounakdev
